meta {
  name: Delete a session
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/chat/sessions/{{threadId}}
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 204
}

docs {
  Deletes one of the caller's own sessions: the saved conversation and its entry in the session list. A session that is not the caller's is a 404, the same as an unknown one
  (so is one already deleted). While a turn is running on it the answer is a 409 with `code: thread_busy`: try again when the turn has finished or been cancelled. A message sent
  on the same `thread_id` afterwards starts a new conversation. This does not remove copies of the text held by Langfuse or the gateway's logs.
}
